help-000#procedure Returns for a buyer in the north region
Open Orders, choose the item, and select Request return within 30 days of delivery. This procedure applies to the buyer account in the north region. Keep the order or listing ID when contacting support. Never include payment credentials.
help-001#procedure Refunds for a buyer in the north region
A refund is issued to the original payment method within 5 business days after inspection. This procedure applies to the buyer account in the north region. Keep the order or listing ID when contacting support. Never include payment credentials.
help-009#procedure Payment for a buyer in the north region
Check the payment details and available funds, then retry once. Do not send card numbers in a support message. This procedure applies to the buyer account in the north region. Keep the order or listing ID when contacting support. Never include payment credentials.
help-005#procedure Cancellation for a buyer in the north region
Use Cancel order before the seller marks it dispatched. After dispatch, use the return process. This procedure applies to the buyer account in the north region. Keep the order or listing ID when contacting support. Never include payment credentials.
